/T (Jubert recalled what Ikneus had told him about his cup there.  In some contests, he went down in flames and faced a heavy, acrimonious scolding from his father. His mother held a maudlin cry asking him over and over again if he was flagging, and if he felt he needed to restart his training from square one. No wonder his brothers managed to laugh up their sleeves even in those tenebrous times, pert of the reason why he does not talk much with his brothers. That was the reason why he occasionally obfuscated his news when speaking with his family, especially that news which he knew he would be pushed into hot water with his parents, or that news which gave him a trepidation that his grandfather might hit the ceiling.)
