/T (Erkbulies are very gentle and complex creatures. Typically having round eyes with an admirable and colourful glow, silky hair and juicy lips, Erkbulies are reputed for their charm, cheerfulness, and their unwavering commitment to duties and ethics they were taught since childhood. Erkbulies - when loved someone - did so with ineffable feeling. However, they were also notorious for their byzantine psychology - so jungled in instinct and emotion that even they seldomly understood their own emotions.)
